# Load a voxel map from disk, replacing the node's current map
# (fortis_perception voxel_map_node) or setting the diff reference
# (map_diff_node).
#
# path      Source file path (.npz), as written by SaveMap.
# success   True if the map was loaded.
# message   Human-readable detail: voxel count on success, the error otherwise.

string path
---
bool success
string message
